* cassie mayr circuit breaker

.SUBCKT Sw_1Phase_off_mayr in out
+PARAMS:
+t_Stop=0.5
+t_Start=1e6
+tsw=100u toff=1m ; on and off switching times 
+ron=0.01
+roff=1e9
+vt=0.9
+vh=0
+ p0=0.1 ; 
+ p0_mult=7e9
+ Gmin=1e-7
+ theta=1e-4
+ ginit=1000 
* arc model
* ON-Switcher
*Xmov1 out 0 mov1 params: vbo={vin*2/1.73205} exp={exp}
*Xmov2 in 0 mov1 params: vbo={vin*2/1.73205} exp={exp} 
Vsw1 ctrl 0 PWL(0s 0 {t_Start+1p} 0 {t_Start+tsw+2p} 1 )
S1 in out ctrl 0 MS1
.model MS1 SW(Ron={ron} Roff={roff} Vt={Vt} Vh={Vh} Lser=0 Vser=0)
* OFF-Switcher
VP0 p0 0 pwl 0s 1 {t_Stop} 1 {t_Stop+toff+1p} {P0_mult} ; to stop the arc  
VGmin Gmin 0 1
VTheta theta 0 1
V0 in in1 0
E2 b1 0 VALUE={((i(v0)*i(v0))/(P0*v(P0)))} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
EG G 0 VALUE={v(idt1)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
G1x 0 idt1  VALUE={(-v(G)+Gmin*v(Gmin)+v(b1))/(Theta*v(Theta))} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
C1x idt1 0 1 IC={ginit}
R1x idt1 0 1e10
G0 in1 out value={V(in1,out)*v(G)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
.ENDS

